                                "sense_id": "49fcb0e6-0ba4-34c1-badc-64d03d19792c",
                                "text": "[Wilfred:] In tears, eh? What a plague art thou grizzling for now?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5470c05-a202-4b90-8e41-3576fa6db384",
                                "sense_id": "49fcb0e6-0ba4-34c1-badc-64d03d19792c",
                                "text": "R. J. Tizard — What are you grizzling about now?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f2380d1-fd97-4798-b8dc-e96c5b8f61d3",
                                "sense_id": "49fcb0e6-0ba4-34c1-badc-64d03d19792c",
                                "text": "The pin-thin girl is grizzling, whining that she has sand in her eyes."
                            }
